          ],
          "text": "- You have orthopaedic fracture clinic follow-up at 2 weeks.\n- You have a general surgery telephone review about your spleen at 6 weeks. Splenic vaccination advice will be given at that review.\n- There is no routine follow-up with the respiratory or thoracic team."
